# Written into the working tree by `next dev` and `next build`, not by anybody here. They are
# instructions to whatever tooling is driving the editor, they describe the installed framework
# rather than this system, and they are re-created on every run — so committing them would put a
# file in the repository that nothing in the repository is the source of. Ignored so that a
# wholesale `git add` cannot sweep them into a card's diff.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
